# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CDP Browser MCP — .gitignore (MAIN branch)
# Branch policy: main is public. Dev-only material (_archive/,
# .research/, .githooks/) lives on the dev branch only — never add it
# here. The promote workflow deletes those paths at merge time;
# these rules are the backstop. See root AGENTS.md → "Branch policy".
# (Dev branch uses the same filename with different content —
#  no _archive/.research/.githooks rules there, plus policy pointer.)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Branch-policy guards (MAIN ONLY — dev branch tracks these) ──
_archive/
.research/
.githooks/

# ── Dependencies (never commit) ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ── Build output (never commit; releases ship dist/ via CI) ──
dist/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# ── Temp / scratch ──
temp/
tmp/
.temp/
.playwright-mcp/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Prompts / planning docs (local-only) ──
.prompts/

# ── Audit/summary files (never commit) ──
PHASE_*
*_AUDIT*
*_SUMMARY*

# ── Test / debug output ──
*.log
npm-debug.log*
**/*.py[cod]
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/

# ── Local secrets (never commit) ──
.env

# ── OS files ──
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

# ── Local agent/tool state (never commit) ──
# Patterns mirror the hardened userscripts repo convention
.omo/
**/.omo/
**/.codegraph/
**/.taco/
**/.opencode/
**/.opencode-cache/
**/.codex/
**/.continue/
**/.kilocode/
**/.roo/
**/.qoder/
**/.trae/
**/.claude/
**/.gemini/
**/.cursor/
**/.windsurf/
**/.aider*
**/.muse/
**/opencode.log

# ── Local editor / IDE state (never commit) ──
.vscode/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.history/
**/.vs/
